{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19709","headline":"衡州登楼望南馆临水花呈房戴段李诸公 · 吕温","name":"衡州登楼望南馆临水花呈房戴段李诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夭桃临方塘，暮色堪秋思。\n托根岂求润，照影非自媚。\n罥挂青柳丝，零落绿钱地。\n佳期竟何许，时有幽禽至。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}